  "body": "Closes #5854.\n\nDecision record for the per-target customisation follow-on of #5679 (decomposition item 6), settling the question #5853 §5 explicitly left open: the cascade between style assertions, override maps, and raw CSS.\n\n- Cascade: platform defaults → theme/token values → semantic assertions → per-target override map (style, then #5853 presentation overrides) → raw CSS (web only, per-property, reported).\n- Themes: roles not values; base → target → mode variant; OS selects mode on native, user/OS preference respected on web/GUI.\n- Asset substitution: theme asset table vs content-asset substitution vs #5853 presentation assets kept distinct; semantics never change with the asset.\n- Conditional blocks: pre-cascade inclusion of non-essential embellishment only; target-fact predicates, no nesting, unknown predicate = build error.\n- Worked three-target example (web Tailwind / custom GUI image button / native OS button) from the same source, plus invariants, rejected alternatives, and named open sibling dependencies (#5849/#5850/#5851/#5852/#5855 — states re-verified fresh 2026-11-08).\n\nDoc-only; no implementation. Task 13783, lane code-g.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796774476&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7864&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7864&signature=360cb15e1642f364343618ed61083a84818abcad15555feb06452761f66922cb\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7864?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
